      "version": "black-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "The small ball is not only filled with nutrients, it is also tasty. Starly try to peck it off.",
      "version": "white-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sunlight colors it red. When the small ball is drained of nutrients, it shrivels to herald evolution.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "It evolves by sucking the energy out of the small ball where it had been storing nutrients.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sunlight colors it red. When the small ball is drained of nutrients, it shrivels to herald evolution.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "It evolves by sucking the energy out of the small ball where it had been storing nutrients.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It nimbly dashes about to avoid getting pecked by bird Pokémon that would love to make off with its small, nutrient-rich storage ball.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "The deeper a Cherubi’s red, the more nutrients it has stockpiled in its body. And the sweeter and tastier its small ball!",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the fruit growing alongside the main body is large and plump, Cherubi will use the nutrients within to evolve. The fruit then detaches, becoming nourishment for other creatures.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
  ],
